3.2 non-functional requirements

 Usability: clear navigation, dashboards, status labels and actionable forms for each role.
 Maintainability: distinct API, MVC, contracts and test projects with controller/service separation.
 Security: password hashing, authentication, role restrictions, ownership checks and secret

     configuration outside published images.
 Reliability: relational data constraints, validation, controlled HTTP responses and regression tests.
 Portability: Docker images for consistent .NET 8 application packaging.
 Traceability: source history and automated GitHub Actions build/test results.

