12. GitHub version control and continuous integration

Git was used to track the project, and GitHub hosts the RaceDay_Part2 repository.
The final project work was maintained on the POE branch, keeping master
unchanged. The reported finalisation commit was e7ba8cb. GitHub Actions workflow
#53 passed after the final push, providing automated evidence that the repository
version builds and tests successfully.

The developer maintained a separate Git working copy for the final push and verified
a clean working tree before container builds. Generated files and sensitive
configuration were excluded from the Docker build context. The repository history, CI
execution and Docker images together provide traceable evidence of the delivered
solution.

